{"unit_id":"yupaoa__dsh-image-lite#card-zh","repo":"yupaoa/dsh-image-lite","commit":"b679150fae8d550dbafda286d663fcecbe3438e9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-lite 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的生图插件，提供对话工具和侧边栏生图工作台。它在 DSH 注册 image_generate_lite，并在会话侧栏提供模型库、比例选择、参考图管理与结果预览。用户可以用文字生成图片，也可以上传或沿用已有图片继续编辑；生成结果保存到会话工作区或指定目录，并作为附件供后续使用。适合需要在 DSH 会话中创作和反复调整图片的用户。使用前需配置图像供应商、模型和经 DSH 凭据服务管理的 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:505-620","client.js:1809-1894","index.js:420-485"]}
{"unit_id":"yupaoa__dsh-image-lite#card-en","repo":"yupaoa/dsh-image-lite","commit":"b679150fae8d550dbafda286d663fcecbe3438e9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-image-lite brings image generation to DSH chat and a sidebar studio. Use image_generate_lite to create or edit images from prompts and references. Choose a model, manage references, preview results, and save images to the session folder. Configure a provider and API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:505-620","client.js:1809-1894","index.js:420-485"]}
