{"unit_id":"yupaoa__dsh-image-lite#feature-1","repo":"yupaoa/dsh-image-lite","commit":"b679150fae8d550dbafda286d663fcecbe3438e9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-lite 的功能「对话文生图」：在 DSH 会话中调用 image_generate_lite，输入文字提示、可选比例和质量，生成图片并在对话结果中返回图片附件。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:505-620"]}
